[7.90853, "o", "# Development users\r\n\r\nUsers in the development database `data/docshare.db` (built by `python -m docshare.seed`). The tokens\r\nare development fixtures only.\r\n\r\n| Name | Email | Home organisation | Memberships | Support | Token |\r\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n| Anna Lindqvist | anna@haldenprice.example | Halden & Price LLP | Halden & Price LLP (org_admin) | no | `dsk_c35d7d3b92e4016e27e47ffc284a2d4f` |\r\n| Ben Carver | ben@haldenprice.example | Halden & Price LLP | Halden & Price LLP (member) | no | `dsk_2e09e4b8245edebc817af708207473b7` |\r\n| Chloe Ndiaye | chloe@marlowclinic.example | Marlow Community Clinic | Marlow Community Clinic (org_admin) | no | `dsk_91d5d9efb044d527dd1775a93cdba284` |\r\n| Dev Patel | dev@marlowclinic.example | Marlow Community Clinic | Marlow Community Clinic (member) | no | `dsk_46371f37e9a462ce0fa030a07210d3db` |\r\n| Elena Rossi | elena@tessaract.example | Tessaract Robotics | Tessaract Robotics (org_admin) | no | `dsk_ac0e36d556132dfb84492cd42b1141d6` |\r\n| Felix Brandt | felix@tessaract"]
[7.908577, "o", ".example | Tessaract Robotics | Tessaract Robotics (member) | no | `dsk_c958a7924e9a430cbcfdc56a522162b3` |\r\n| Grace Okafor | grace@okafor-consulting.example | Marlow Community Clinic | Marlow Community Clinic (member), Tessaract Robotics (org_admin) | no | `dsk_1428dfad70ce79934498d7d67c213c12` |\r\n| Riley Chen | riley@support.docshare.example | none | none | yes | `dsk_f9c215672ac38adf41b079157a6d7ff3` |\r\n\r\n| Organisation | Id |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| Halden & Price LLP | `21bade02-6a6a-4768-b2ed-66ffdcc99396` |\r\n| Marlow Community Clinic | `6102dd70-63e8-440e-9dd8-904f07489671` |\r\n| Tessaract Robotics | `83faac57-2f56-4652-866d-e486522c4f8d` |\r\n"]
